Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|test.run.environment|EE|
		|testray.main.component.name|Kaleo Forms Admin|
	And these variables
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|test.run.environment|EE|
		|testray.main.component.name|Kaleo Forms Admin|
		|kfFieldSetName|New Kaleo Field Set|
		|workflowAssetType|Process|
Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG
Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|
Scenario: Add Field Set With Documents And Media Field
Priority: 3
	Given Navigator open URL
	When ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Kaleo Forms Admin|
	And KaleoFormsAdmin add Process
	And KaleoFormsAdmin add Process Details
		|kfProcessDescription|Kaleo Forms Process Description|
		|kfProcessName|Kaleo Forms Process|
	And KaleoFormsAdmin next
	And KaleoFormsAdmin add Field Set
		|kfFieldSetName|New Kaleo Field Set|
		|kfProcessName|Kaleo Forms Process|
	And DynamicDataMapping add Field
		|field|Documents and Media|
		|fieldFieldLabel|DM Test Field|
		|fieldName|DMTestField|
	And KaleoFormsAdmin save Field Set
	And KaleoFormsAdmin choose Field Set
		|kfFieldSetName|New Kaleo Field Set|
		|kfProcessName|Kaleo Forms Process|
	And KaleoFormsAdmin next
	And KaleoFormsAdmin choose Workflow
		|kfProcessName|Kaleo Forms Process|
		|workflowDefinitionTitle|Single Approver|
	And KaleoFormsAdmin next
	And KaleoFormsAdmin assign Form
		|kfProcessName|Kaleo Forms Process|
		|workflowTask|create|
	And KaleoFormsAdmin add Form
		|kfFormName|Created Task Form|
	And KaleoFormsAdmin save Form
	And KaleoFormsAdmin choose Form
		|kfFormName|Created Task Form|
	And KaleoFormsAdmin save Process
		|kfProcessName|Kaleo Forms Process|
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Kaleo Forms Admin|
	Then KaleoFormsAdmin view Process
		|kfProcessName|Kaleo Forms Process|
Scenario: Add Process With New Field Set And Workflow Via Source Tab
Priority: 3
	Given Navigator open URL
	When ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Kaleo Forms Admin|
	And KaleoFormsAdmin add Process
	And KaleoFormsAdmin add Process Details
		|kfProcessDescription|Kaleo Forms Process Description|
		|kfProcessName|Kaleo Forms Process|
	And KaleoFormsAdmin next
	And KaleoFormsAdmin add Field Set
		|kfFieldSetName|New Kaleo Field Set|
		|kfProcessName|Kaleo Forms Process|
	And DynamicDataMapping add Field
		|field|Boolean|
		|fieldFieldLabel|Boolean|
		|fieldName|Boolean|
	And KaleoFormsAdmin save Field Set
	And KaleoFormsAdmin choose Field Set
		|kfFieldSetName|New Kaleo Field Set|
		|kfProcessName|Kaleo Forms Process|
	And KaleoFormsAdmin next
	And KaleoFormsAdmin add Workflow
		|kfProcessName|Kaleo Forms Process|
		|workflowDefinitionTitle|Workflow Definition Title|
	And KaleoDesigner add Source XML Basic Definition
	And KaleoFormsAdmin publish Workflow
		|workflowDefinitionTitle|Workflow Definition Title|
	And KaleoFormsAdmin choose Workflow
		|kfProcessName|Kaleo Forms Process|
		|workflowDefinitionTitle|Workflow Definition Title|
	And KaleoFormsAdmin next
	And KaleoFormsAdmin assign Form
		|kfProcessName|Kaleo Forms Process|
		|workflowTask|TestStartNode|
	And KaleoFormsAdmin add Form
		|kfFormName|Created Task Form|
	And KaleoFormsAdmin save Form
	And KaleoFormsAdmin choose Form
		|kfFormName|Created Task Form|
	And KaleoFormsAdmin save Process
		|kfProcessName|Kaleo Forms Process|
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Kaleo Forms Admin|
	Then KaleoFormsAdmin view Process
		|kfProcessName|Kaleo Forms Process|
Scenario: Deactivate And Activate Workflow Definition
Priority: 3
	Given Navigator open URL
	When ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Kaleo Forms Admin|
	And KaleoFormsAdmin add Process
	And KaleoFormsAdmin add Process Details
		|kfProcessDescription|Kaleo Forms Process Description|
		|kfProcessName|Kaleo Forms Process|
	And KaleoFormsAdmin next
	And KaleoFormsAdmin add Field Set
		|kfFieldSetName|New Kaleo Field Set|
		|kfProcessName|Kaleo Forms Process|
	And DynamicDataMapping add Field
		|field|Text|
		|fieldFieldLabel|Text|
		|fieldName|Text|
	And KaleoFormsAdmin save Field Set
	And KaleoFormsAdmin choose Field Set
		|kfFieldSetName|New Kaleo Field Set|
		|kfProcessName|Kaleo Forms Process|
	And KaleoFormsAdmin next
	And KaleoFormsAdmin deactivate Workflow
		|workflowDefinitionTitle|Single Approver|
	And KaleoFormsAdmin view No Published Workflow Definitions
	And KaleoFormsAdmin view No Unpublished Workflow Definitions
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Configuration
		|portlet|Workflow Definition|
	And Workflow reactivate Inactive Workflow Definition
		|workflowDefinitionName|Single Approver|
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Kaleo Forms Admin|
	And KaleoFormsAdmin add Process
	And KaleoFormsAdmin add Process Details
		|kfProcessDescription|Kaleo Forms Process Description|
		|kfProcessName|Kaleo Forms Process|
	And KaleoFormsAdmin next
	And KaleoFormsAdmin choose Field Set
		|kfFieldSetName|New Kaleo Field Set|
		|kfProcessName|Kaleo Forms Process|
	And KaleoFormsAdmin next
	And these variables
		|key_workflowDefinitionTitle|Single Approver|
	And AssertTextEquals the value 'Single Approver' at locator 'KaleoFormsAdminEditProcess#WORKFLOW_TABLE_TITLE'
	And these variables
		|key_rowEntry|Single Approver|
	And AssertElementPresent at locator 'Icon#ROW_VERTICAL_ELLIPSIS'
	Then KaleoFormsAdmin view No Unpublished Workflow Definitions
